  <Sequence sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText="Sends an HTTP request and retries transient failures (timeouts, network errors, HTTP 408, 429 and 5xx) with exponential backoff.&#xA;&#xA;Precondition: URL, and optionally method, headers and body.&#xA;Postcondition: Status code and response body returned. Throws BusinessRuleException for client errors (e.g. 400, 404, 422) and a System Exception for 401, 403, timeouts, 429 and 5xx after the last attempt, unless in_bool_ContinueOnError is True." DisplayName="HttpRequestWithRetry">
